# Sinister Cryologist's warp {U} (CR 702.185a): cast from the hand for {U}, paid exactly by Mox Sapphire (the Jet's {B} is left
# in the pool). A Mox Jet cannot pay it - a warp cast with only {B} is refused - the enters trigger finds no opposing creature to target, and
# the creature is exiled at the beginning of the next end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Sinister Cryologist
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Sinister Cryologist.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sinister Cryologist.Cast(Ability: Warp)
? Bot1.Mana = {B}
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sinister Cryologist.Types = Creature
[Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Exile = Sinister Cryologist
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire
